    <apiVersion>66.0</apiVersion>
    <description>Runs runProgramProcessForTransactionJournal on each new Pending TJ so configured LoyaltyProgramProcess rules execute immediately. Fault path swallows errors (e.g. when no Program Process Flow is configured in Setup) so failures never roll back the TJ insert or the checkout. Balance stays correct via LoyaltyAccountController.pendingJournalDelta() until Program Process is fully configured.</description>
